{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53516","headline":"赠苏小 · 李涉","name":"赠苏小","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地人仙人家洛浦，闻道新年年十五。\n巧转明眸双剑连，开粧一面千花吐。\n流苏帐，云母屏，碧罗作卷花亭亭。\n崑仑阿母暗鈎引，东海麻姑投姓名。\n梭能织诗筝解语，鸳鸯难称烟波侣。\n偶逢曼倩巧言词，不觉投花忽相许。\n自言夫婿心不骨，黄金买笑轻侯王。\n掌中看舞腰欲断，暗里听歌愁满堂。\n莫学爲云去无迹，巫山高高接天碧。\n（同前第五五一页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53516.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53516","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}